error[E0277]: `ReadOnlyConnection` may only read, so it cannot run this write
 --> tests/read-only-fail/batch_execute_on_read_only_connection.rs:4:8
  |
4 |     db.batch_execute("DROP TABLE cake").await
  |        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this writes, which needs a `ConnectionMut`
  |
  = help: the trait `ConnectionMut` is not implemented for `ReadOnlyConnection`
  = note: a `DatabaseConnection` or `DatabaseTransaction`, and the metrics wrappers around them, may write; a `ReadOnlyConnection`, a `ReadOnlyTransaction`, a connection's `read_only()`, and code generic over `Connection` may only read
  = help: the following other types implement trait `ConnectionMut`:
            &DatabaseConnection
            &mut C
            DatabaseConnection
            DatabaseRef<'_, M>
            DatabaseTransaction<'_>
            HookConnection<'_>
            pgorm::metric::InstrumentedConnection<M, C>
            pgorm::metric::InstrumentedTransaction<'_, M, T>
note: required by a bound in `batch_execute`
